>
> I wish that group had a less inflammatory title than "English is
> stupid, I'm learning Lojban".
>
> I can like Lojban without having to think that English is stupid,
> can't it? That's like the irritating Esperanto advocates who say,
> "Don't learn <language>, learn Esperanto instead!" -- you can learn
